  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMS MENA 2022 2025 - IMS MENA 2022 2025 OLD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IMS MENA 2022 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till oberoende media i MENA regionen f&#xf6;r att underst&#xf6;dja kritiskt t&#xe4;nkande bland allm&#xe4;nheten</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to independent media organisations in the MENA region to promote critical thinking among the public</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of IMS programme in MENA is to contribute to a vibrant and inclusive civic space where the media engenders actions that further human rights, accountability and social, political and cultural change. 

IMS has identified two strategic priorities to bring about its overall impact goal in the MENA Region: 
One: Enhance the quality and inclusivity of public interest content and the viability of the media outlets producing and distributing this content. 
Two: Create conditions that encourage the viable production, distribution and consumption of inclusive public interest content; an &quot;enabling environment&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
